  "findings": "Initial purple coverage was excessive. Reduced flowering-shoot density, regenerated and reviewed current pilots and sheet. Low green mats retain exposed foliage between upright purple marks. Correct 7-12 cm habit; 15-20 mm corollas and heart-shaped leaves are unresolved at 25 mm. Actually compared reference photographs, current seeds 1, 4, 7 and all 36 seeded variants. Accepted as coarse colony-scale spring geometry, not close-up botanical microdetail. Variant endorsement remains a user decision.",
